      "geometry": "rect",
      "text": "Data note: Peng et al. 2025 source archive Fig. 1; local table fig1_event_coupling.csv. Niño-3 is the eastern equatorial Pacific SST region; u10 is 10-m zonal wind; SOI is the Southern Oscillation Index. For 2023, Niño-3=1.929, u10=0.640, SOI=-0.433; u10 and SOI response ratios are only 0.27 and 0.31. How to read: the left panel reproduces the paper's SST, MSLP/u10, and scatter relationships; the right panel compresses them into response ratios. The anomaly is not weak SST, but a weak atmospheric response relative to historical slopes.",
